## Kimi becomes the player's lover (CLAUDE.md §6.1): plays right after the player
## gives their girlfriend her special gift, a blue ribbon that says "1st".
## PLACEHOLDER: all dialogue in this file is placeholder for the owner to rewrite.

label kimi_lover:
    show kimi neutral at center
    with dissolve

    # PLACEHOLDER
    "Kimi turns the ribbon over in her hands. It's blue. It says {i}1st{/i} in shiny gold letters."
    kimi "Oh."
    kimi "I've won a lot of ribbons. Third place. Most Helpful. Honorable Mention. Participation, eleven times."
    kimi "Nobody's ever... I've never been anyone's first choice. Not once. I'm the one people ask when the first choice is busy."
    "She pins it to her lanyard, right in the middle, above all twelve club badges."
    kimi "This one goes on top. Forever. Every club will have to look at it."
    kimi "I love you, [player_name]. I'm saying it once, slowly, so you know I mean it. I love you."

    hide kimi
    with dissolve
    return
